#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Cellaris"
msgstr "Cellaris"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Predicted Orion multiplex-IF markers (Hoechst, Pan-CK, SMA) overlaid on H&E, "
"with a readout of the predicted values over a region. Research use only: "
"predictions are not measurements and are not for diagnosis."
msgstr ""
"H&E 위에 Orion 다중 면역형광 마커(Hoechst, Pan-CK, SMA)의 예측값을 겹쳐 표시"
"하고, 영역 내 예측값에 대한 분석 결과를 제공합니다. 연구용으로만 사용: 예측값"
"은 측정값이 아니며 진단에 사용할 수 없습니다."

#. Translators: shown wherever predicted colours are. Keep all of its
#. meaning: the colours are a model's prediction, not a measurement; for
#. research only; never for diagnosis.
#: src/config.rs:34
msgid "PREDICTED — research use only, not for diagnosis"
msgstr "예측값 — 연구용으로만 사용, 진단에 사용할 수 없음"

#. Translators: {key} is the name of a setting in Cellaris's
#. settings.json and {value} its value there; neither is
#. translated.
#: src/config.rs:130
msgid "ignored the setting {key} = {value}"
msgstr "설정 {key} = {value}을(를) 무시했습니다"

#. Translators: {low} and {high} are the ends of a
#. marker's display window as settings.json gives
#. them, {name} the marker (not translated).
#: src/config.rs:210
msgid "ignored the display window {low}–{high} of {name}"
msgstr "{name}의 표시 범위 {low}–{high}을(를) 무시했습니다"

#: src/engine.rs:732
msgid "Cellaris hit an internal error and reset its model"
msgstr "Cellaris에 내부 오류가 발생하여 모델을 초기화했습니다"

#: src/engine.rs:737
msgid "Cellaris hit an internal error"
msgstr "Cellaris에 내부 오류가 발생했습니다"

#: src/engine.rs:928
msgid "Loading the model crashed"
msgstr "모델을 불러오는 중 충돌이 발생했습니다"

#: src/engine.rs:960
msgid "Cellaris cannot show the chosen markers"
msgstr "Cellaris에서 선택한 마커를 표시할 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: {} says why the model did not load.
#: src/engine.rs:991
msgid "The model did not load: {}"
msgstr "모델을 불러오지 못했습니다: {}"

#. Translators: why a region readout stopped; a cell is one
#. square of the grid the slide is predicted in, not a
#. biological cell. {error} says what went wrong.
#: src/engine.rs:1195
msgid "{n} cell failed: {error}"
msgid_plural "{n} cells failed: {error}"
msgstr[0] "셀 {n}개 계산 실패: {error}"

#. Translators: {n} cells of a region's {total} could not be
#. computed: the form follows {n}, and {total} is a bare
#. number. A cell is one square of the grid the slide is
#. predicted in, not a biological cell. {error} says what went
#. wrong.
#: src/engine.rs:1205
msgid "{n} cell of {total} could not be computed: {error}"
msgid_plural "{n} cells of {total} could not be computed: {error}"
msgstr[0] "셀 {total}개 중 {n}개를 계산할 수 없습니다: {error}"

#. Translators: why a region readout stopped.
#: src/engine.rs:1282
msgid "replaced by a new region"
msgstr "새 영역으로 대체됨"

#: src/engine.rs:1294
msgid "No part of that region is on the slide."
msgstr "해당 영역에는 슬라이드 위에 놓인 부분이 없습니다."

#. Translators: a window is one of the square images the
#. model predicts from.
#: src/engine.rs:1299
msgid "That region needs more than {n} window. Draw a smaller one."
msgid_plural "That region needs more than {n} windows. Draw a smaller one."
msgstr[0] ""
"해당 영역에는 윈도우가 {n}개 넘게 필요합니다. 더 작은 영역을 그리세요."

#. Translators: the title of the question asked before a long
#. region readout; a readout summarises the model's predicted
#. values over the region, it is not a measurement.
#: src/engine.rs:1332
msgid "Compute a readout of a large region?"
msgstr "큰 영역의 분석 결과를 계산하시겠습니까?"

#. Translators: {n} windows (square images the model
#. predicts from); {time} is a duration that already
#. says "about", such as "about 3 min".
#: src/engine.rs:1337
msgid ""
"This region needs about {n} more window of predictions; computing it takes "
"{time} on this computer. The overlay keeps working meanwhile, and the "
"readout can be cancelled."
msgid_plural ""
"This region needs about {n} more windows of predictions; computing them "
"takes {time} on this computer. The overlay keeps working meanwhile, and the "
"readout can be cancelled."
msgstr[0] ""
"이 영역에는 예측 윈도우가 약 {n}개 더 필요하며, 이 컴퓨터에서 계산하는 데 "
"{time} 걸립니다. 그동안 오버레이는 계속 작동하며, 분석은 취소할 수 있습니다."

#. Translators: the button that starts the long readout (it
#. computes the missing predictions and summarises them).
#: src/engine.rs:1344
msgid "Compute"
msgstr "계산"

#. Translators: the button that does not start it.
#: src/engine.rs:1346
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "취소"

#. Translators: why part of a slide was not computed: eov is
#. shutting down.
#: src/engine.rs:1444
msgid "stopping"
msgstr "종료 중"

#. Translators: the model failed unexpectedly; {} is the
#. internal error.
#: src/engine.rs:1461
msgid "inference crashed: {}"
msgstr "추론 중 충돌이 발생했습니다: {}"

#. Translators: {} says why the model could not predict.
#: src/engine.rs:1482
msgid "inference failed: {}"
msgstr "추론에 실패했습니다: {}"

#: src/engine.rs:1615
msgid "Cellaris could not compute part of the slide; retrying"
msgstr "Cellaris가 슬라이드 일부를 계산하지 못해 다시 시도하는 중입니다"

#. Translators: the names of the layers Cellaris draws on a slide.
#: src/engine.rs:2047
msgid "Cellaris — predicted markers (research use only)"
msgstr "Cellaris — 예측 마커(연구용으로만 사용)"

#: src/engine.rs:2048
msgid "Cellaris — progress"
msgstr "Cellaris — 진행 상황"

#. Translators: the layer with the outline of a region readout's region;
#. the readout summarises predicted values, so do not call the region
#. measured.
#: src/engine.rs:2052
msgid "Cellaris — readout region"
msgstr "Cellaris — 분석 영역"

#: src/engine.rs:2053
msgid "Cellaris — predicted values (research use only)"
msgstr "Cellaris — 예측값(연구용으로만 사용)"

#. Translators: the name of the tool that outlines a region for a readout,
#. and the title of the readout while it runs. A readout summarises the
#. model's predicted values over the region: do not call it a measurement.
#: src/engine.rs:2086
msgid "Cellaris region readout"
msgstr "Cellaris 영역 분석"

#. Translators: why nothing could be predicted, for the overlay or for a
#. region readout.
#: src/engine.rs:2093
msgid "the model is not loaded"
msgstr "모델을 불러오지 않았습니다"

#. Translators: why a region readout stopped.
#: src/engine.rs:2099
msgid "the slide was closed"
msgstr "슬라이드가 닫혔습니다"

#. Translators: why part of a slide was not predicted; {} is eov's reason.
#: src/engine.rs:2105
msgid "the slide could not be read: {}"
msgstr "슬라이드를 읽을 수 없습니다: {}"

#. Translators: the quoted words name the Cellaris panel's
#. check box "Assume the model's pixel size for slides that
#. report none": use the same words as there.
#: src/geometry.rs:83
msgid ""
"This slide does not report its pixel size, so it cannot be matched to the "
"model's. Turn on “Assume the model's pixel size” in the Cellaris panel to "
"run anyway."
msgstr ""
"이 슬라이드에는 픽셀 크기 정보가 없어 모델의 픽셀 크기와 맞출 수 없습니다. 그"
"래도 실행하려면 Cellaris 패널에서 “모델의 픽셀 크기로 가정”을 켜세요."

#. Translators: µm/px is micrometres per pixel; {factor}× is how
#. many times coarser.
#: src/geometry.rs:91
msgid ""
"This slide is scanned at {slide} µm/px, more than {factor}× coarser than the "
"{model} µm/px the model was trained at; predictions would be meaningless."
msgstr ""
"이 슬라이드는 {slide} µm/px로 스캔되어, 모델이 학습한 {model} µm/px보다 해상"
"도가 {factor}× 넘게 낮습니다. 예측해도 의미가 없습니다."

#. Translators: {} is a pixel size, as the model gives it.
#: src/geometry.rs:195
msgid "the model's pixel size {} is not usable"
msgstr "모델의 픽셀 크기 {}은(는) 사용할 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: {window} is a size in pixels (px).
#: src/geometry.rs:202
msgid "the model's window of {window} px is not a multiple of {multiple}"
msgstr "모델의 윈도우 크기({window} px)가 {multiple}의 배수가 아닙니다"

#: src/geometry.rs:215
msgid "the slide is empty"
msgstr "슬라이드가 비어 있습니다"

#. Translators: a pyramid level is one of the resolutions a slide
#. is stored at; µm/px is micrometres per pixel.
#: src/geometry.rs:246
msgid ""
"no pyramid level is close to the model's {mpp} µm/px; a window would need "
"{width}×{height} pixels"
msgstr ""
"모델의 {mpp} µm/px에 가까운 피라미드 레벨이 없습니다. 윈도우 하나에 {width}"
"×{height} 픽셀이 필요합니다"

#. Translators: the tooltip of the toolbar button that shows or hides the
#. predicted markers; H&E is haematoxylin and eosin. Keep "research use
#. only".
#: src/lib.rs:94
msgid "Cellaris: predicted markers over H&E (research use only)"
msgstr "Cellaris: H&E 위 예측 마커(연구용으로만 사용)"

#. Translators: the tooltip of the toolbar button that shows or hides the
#. Cellaris panel.
#: src/lib.rs:115
msgid "Cellaris panel: legend, region readout and model"
msgstr "Cellaris 패널: 범례, 영역 분석, 모델"

#. Translators: a warning; {} is eov's reason, in English.
#: src/lib.rs:164
msgid "Cellaris could not save its settings: {}"
msgstr "Cellaris 설정을 저장할 수 없습니다: {}"

#: src/lib.rs:348
msgid "The Cellaris panel could not open"
msgstr "Cellaris 패널을 열 수 없습니다"

#: src/lib.rs:401
msgid "Open a slide first."
msgstr "먼저 슬라이드를 여세요."

#. Translators: the ROI tool is eov's region-of-interest tool;
#. "Cellaris region readout" is the name of Cellaris's tool (use
#. the same words as there).
#: src/lib.rs:414
msgid ""
"This slide has no region of interest; draw one with the ROI tool, or outline "
"a region with the Cellaris region readout tool."
msgstr ""
"이 슬라이드에는 관심 영역이 없습니다. ROI 도구로 관심 영역을 그리거나 "
"Cellaris 영역 분석 도구로 영역의 윤곽을 그리세요."

#: src/lib.rs:498
msgid "Readout copied as tab-separated text."
msgstr "분석 결과를 탭으로 구분된 텍스트로 복사했습니다."

#: src/lib.rs:503
msgid "There is no finished readout to copy."
msgstr "복사할 완료된 분석 결과가 없습니다."

#. Translators: a kind of file in the file dialog.
#: src/lib.rs:536
msgid "ONNX Runtime library"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime 라이브러리"

#. Translators: a kind of file in the file dialog.
#: src/lib.rs:540
msgid "ONNX model"
msgstr "ONNX 모델"

#. Translators: the title of the file dialog.
#: src/lib.rs:557
msgid "Choose a Cellaris marker model"
msgstr "Cellaris 마커 모델 선택"

#. Translators: the title of the file dialog.
#: src/lib.rs:559
msgid "Choose the ONNX Runtime library"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime 라이브러리 선택"

#. Translators: SHA-256 is a checksum (not translated); hex digits
#. are 0–9 and a–f.
#: src/lib.rs:638
msgid ""
"Enter the model's SHA-256 (64 hex digits): the download is checked against "
"it."
msgstr ""
"모델의 SHA-256(16진수 64자리)을 입력하세요. 다운로드한 파일을 이 값으로 확인"
"합니다."

#. Translators: "Choose model…" is the panel's button: use the
#. same words as there.
#: src/lib.rs:672
msgid ""
"This eov cannot download models: choose the model file with Choose model…"
msgstr ""
"이 eov에서는 모델을 다운로드할 수 없습니다. 모델 선택…으로 모델 파일을 선택하"
"세요."

#: src/lib.rs:957
msgid "Outline a region with at least three points."
msgstr "점 3개 이상으로 영역의 윤곽을 그리세요."

#. Translators: {reason} is eov's explanation, a whole
#. sentence; {key} is the name of a setting in
#. settings.json, and "" an empty value there (neither
#. is translated).
#: src/lib.rs:1031
msgid ""
"{reason} Another key can be set as {key} in Cellaris's settings.json (\"\" "
"for none)."
msgstr ""
"{reason} Cellaris의 settings.json에서 {key}에 다른 키를 지정할 수 있습니다(지"
"정하지 않으려면 \"\")."

#. Translators: eov did not accept something Cellaris
#. registered: {id} is its identifier and {what} the kind of
#. registration as eov names it in English, such as
#. "hotkey" (neither is translated); {reason} is eov's
#. explanation, a whole sentence.
#: src/lib.rs:1042
msgid "eov refused to register {id} ({what}): {reason}"
msgstr "eov가 {id}({what})의 등록을 거부했습니다: {reason}"

#: src/markers.rs:182
msgid "no markers are selected"
msgstr "선택한 마커가 없습니다"

#: src/markers.rs:185
msgid "at most {n} marker can be shown at once"
msgid_plural "at most {n} markers can be shown at once"
msgstr[0] "마커는 한 번에 최대 {n}개까지 표시할 수 있습니다"

#. Translators: {} is a marker's name, such as Pan-CK.
#: src/markers.rs:194
msgid "{} is selected twice"
msgstr "{}이(가) 두 번 선택되었습니다"

#. Translators: {} is a marker's name, such as Pan-CK; a
#. channel is one of the markers the model predicts.
#: src/markers.rs:203
msgid "the model has no channel named {}"
msgstr "모델에 {}(이)라는 채널이 없습니다"

#. Translators: {} is a marker's name, such as Pan-CK; its display
#. window is the range of values its colour is drawn over.
#: src/markers.rs:212
msgid "no display window is known for {}"
msgstr "{}의 표시 범위를 알 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: the colours of the predicted markers, named in the
#. legend over the slide ("Hoechst: yellow").
#: src/markers.rs:367
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "yellow"
msgstr "노란색"

#: src/markers.rs:368
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "magenta"
msgstr "마젠타"

#: src/markers.rs:369
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "bluish green"
msgstr "청록색"

#: src/markers.rs:370
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "sky blue"
msgstr "하늘색"

#: src/markers.rs:371
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "orange"
msgstr "주황색"

#: src/markers.rs:372
msgctxt "Colour"
msgid "vermilion"
msgstr "주홍색"

#. Translators: CELLARIS_MODEL is an environment variable (not
#. translated); {} is a path.
#: src/model.rs:207
msgid "CELLARIS_MODEL points at {}, which does not exist"
msgstr "CELLARIS_MODEL이 가리키는 {}이(가) 존재하지 않습니다"

#. Translators: {} is the path of the model file the user chose.
#: src/model.rs:219
msgid "the model chosen in the Cellaris panel, {}, does not exist"
msgstr "Cellaris 패널에서 선택한 모델 {}이(가) 존재하지 않습니다"

#. Translators: {file} is the model's file name (markers.onnx), {dir}
#. the folder it is looked for in.
#: src/model.rs:234
msgid "No {file}: put one in {dir}, or choose a model in the Cellaris panel."
msgstr ""
"{file}이(가) 없습니다. {dir}에 넣거나 Cellaris 패널에서 모델을 선택하세요."

#. Translators: channel_names is a key of the model's metadata (not
#. translated); {} is why it could not be read.
#: src/model.rs:272
msgid "channel_names is not a list of names: {}"
msgstr "channel_names가 이름 목록이 아닙니다: {}"

#. Translators: channel_names is a key of the model's metadata (not
#. translated); {} is its value.
#: src/model.rs:283
msgid "channel_names has an empty name: {}"
msgstr "channel_names에 빈 이름이 있습니다: {}"

#. Translators: channel_names is a key of the model's metadata (not
#. translated); {} is a marker's name.
#: src/model.rs:292
msgid "channel_names names {} twice"
msgstr "channel_names에 {}이(가) 두 번 있습니다"

#. Translators: {key} is a key of the model's metadata, {value} its
#. value; true and false are the values it may have (none is
#. translated).
#: src/model.rs:309
msgid "{key} must be true or false, not {value}"
msgstr "{key}은(는) {value}이(가) 아니라 true 또는 false여야 합니다"

#. Translators: {key} is a key of the model's metadata (not translated),
#. {value} its value.
#: src/model.rs:328
msgid "{key} is not a number: {value}"
msgstr "{key}이(가) 숫자가 아닙니다: {value}"

#. Translators: {key} is a key of the model's metadata (not
#. translated), {value} its value, {min} and {max} what it may be.
#: src/model.rs:343
msgid "{key} = {value} is outside {min}–{max}"
msgstr "{key} = {value}이(가) {min}–{max} 범위를 벗어났습니다"

#. Translators: channel_names is a key of the model's metadata and
#. export_marker_onnx a program (neither is translated).
#: src/model.rs:362
msgid ""
"the model carries no channel_names, so its channels cannot be told apart; re-"
"export it with cellaris's export_marker_onnx"
msgstr ""
"모델에 channel_names가 없어 채널을 구별할 수 없습니다. cellaris의 "
"export_marker_onnx로 다시 내보내세요"

#. Translators: a note in the model card; raw_intensity is a key
#. of the model's metadata (not translated). "raw intensities"
#. are the model's predictions on a linear (untransformed) scale,
#. not measured signal.
#: src/model.rs:374
msgid "raw_intensity is not recorded; outputs are taken to be raw intensities"
msgstr "raw_intensity가 기록되어 있지 않아 출력을 원시 강도로 간주합니다"

#. Translators: a note in the model card; {} is a pixel size in
#. micrometres per pixel (µm/px); Orion is a dataset.
#: src/model.rs:386
msgid ""
"the training pixel size is not recorded; {} µm/px (Orion level 0) is assumed"
msgstr ""
"학습 픽셀 크기가 기록되어 있지 않아 {} µm/px(Orion 레벨 0)로 가정합니다"

#. Translators: the shape of the model's input; [batch, 3, height,
#. width] is a notation, keep it as it is.
#: src/model.rs:434
msgid "the input has {n} dimension, not [batch, 3, height, width]"
msgid_plural "the input has {n} dimensions, not [batch, 3, height, width]"
msgstr[0] "입력이 [batch, 3, height, width]가 아니라 {n}차원입니다"

#. Translators: RGB is the colour model of the images (not translated).
#: src/model.rs:442
msgid "the input takes {n} channel, not RGB"
msgid_plural "the input takes {n} channels, not RGB"
msgstr[0] "입력 채널이 RGB가 아니라 {n}개입니다"

#. Translators: {h}×{w} is the size of the model's input in pixels.
#: src/model.rs:455
msgid "the input is {h}×{w}; only square inputs are used"
msgstr "입력이 {h}×{w}입니다. 정사각형 입력만 사용합니다"

#. Translators: {} is a size in pixels (px).
#: src/model.rs:490
msgid "the model's input of {} px is not a multiple of 32 between 64 and 1024"
msgstr "모델의 입력 크기({} px)가 64와 1024 사이의 32의 배수가 아닙니다"

#. Translators: no model file was found (a summary; the details follow).
#: src/model.rs:533
msgid "No marker model"
msgstr "마커 모델 없음"

#. Translators: the file chosen as the model is not one Cellaris can use.
#: src/model.rs:538
msgid "Not a marker model"
msgstr "마커 모델이 아님"

#: src/model.rs:542
msgid "The model's metadata is not usable"
msgstr "모델의 메타데이터를 사용할 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: --param model is a command-line option (not
#. translated); {} is a path.
#: src/model.rs:587
msgid "--param model points at {}, which does not exist"
msgstr "--param model이 가리키는 {}이(가) 존재하지 않습니다"

#. Translators: {path} is the model file, {detail} what is wrong
#. with it.
#: src/model.rs:608
msgid "{path}: {detail}"
msgstr "{path}: {detail}"

#: src/model.rs:613
msgid "The model could not be read"
msgstr "모델을 읽을 수 없습니다"

#: src/model.rs:624
msgid "The model could not be opened"
