"됩니다"

#. Translators: a note on a slide: eov shows it with adjusted colours
#. ({} says how, in eov's words), but the model sees the slide's own.
#: src/present.rs:1283
msgid ""
"the display is adjusted ({}); predictions use the slide's unadjusted colours"
msgstr ""
"화면 표시가 조정되어 있습니다({}). 예측에는 조정되지 않은 슬라이드 원래 색이 "
"사용됩니다"

#: src/present.rs:1298
msgid ""
"The model loads when the overlay is turned on or a region readout starts."
msgstr "모델은 오버레이를 켜거나 영역 분석을 시작할 때 불러옵니다."

#. Translators: cells are the small squares of the slide
#. that are predicted at once.
#: src/present.rs:1321
msgid "{n} cell in view could not be computed"
msgid_plural "{n} cells in view could not be computed"
msgstr[0] "화면에 보이는 셀 {n}개를 계산할 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: {} is how long each window (square image
#. the model predicts from) takes, in seconds.
#: src/present.rs:1333
msgid "Computing · {} s per window"
msgstr "계산 중 · 윈도우당 {}초"

#. Translators: {} is the name of the model that is loaded.
#: src/present.rs:1344
msgid "Ready: {}"
msgstr "준비: {}"

#: src/present.rs:1367
msgid "No slide"
msgstr "슬라이드 없음"

#. Translators: the slide's pixel size in micrometres per pixel
#. (µm/px), the pyramid level it is read from, and how much
#. smaller that level is (×4.00).
#: src/present.rs:1374
msgid "{x} × {y} µm/px, read from level {level} (×{downsample})"
msgstr "{x} × {y} µm/px, 레벨 {level}에서 읽음(×{downsample})"

#. Translators: the slide does not say its pixel size.
#: src/present.rs:1385
msgid "pixel size not reported"
msgstr "픽셀 크기 정보 없음"

#. Translators: under the progress bar in the Cellaris panel; a
#. cell is one square of the grid the slide is predicted in, not a
#. biological cell.
#: src/present.rs:1418
msgid "{done} of {n} cell in view"
msgid_plural "{done} of {n} cells in view"
msgstr[0] "화면에 보이는 셀 {n}개 중 {done}개"

#. Translators: {} is a marker's display window ("arcsinh 4.50–6.50")
#. that the user set.
#: src/present.rs:1446
msgid "{}, yours"
msgstr "{}, 사용자 설정"

#. Translators: eov first asks the user whether to download the model
#. (nothing is downloaded without that answer), then downloads it.
#: src/present.rs:1512
msgid ""
"eov is asking you whether to download the model, or downloading it (see the "
"status bar)…"
msgstr ""
"eov가 모델을 다운로드할지 묻고 있거나 다운로드하는 중입니다(상태 표시줄 참"
"조)…"

#. Translators: under the model's address and SHA-256 in the
#. Cellaris panel; the model store is where eov keeps models.
#: src/present.rs:1521
msgid ""
"eov checks the download against this SHA-256 and keeps it in its model "
"store; it is then Cellaris's model. Without an address, the copy your "
"administrator gave eov is used."
msgstr ""
"eov는 다운로드한 파일을 이 SHA-256으로 확인한 뒤 모델 저장소에 보관하며, 이"
"후 이 파일이 Cellaris의 모델이 됩니다. 주소를 지정하지 않으면 관리자가 eov에 "
"제공한 사본을 사용합니다."

#. Translators: where an ONNX Runtime library was found, shown in
#. parentheses after it in the list of libraries tried.
#: src/runtime.rs:128
msgid "the runtime chosen in the Cellaris panel"
msgstr "Cellaris 패널에서 선택한 런타임"

#: src/runtime.rs:129
msgid "the plugin package"
msgstr "플러그인 패키지"

#: src/runtime.rs:130
msgid "the plugin's data directory"
msgstr "플러그인의 데이터 디렉터리"

#: src/runtime.rs:131
msgid "the system library path"
msgstr "시스템 라이브러리 경로"

#. Translators: {} is the path the user chose for the ONNX
#. Runtime library.
#: src/runtime.rs:142
msgid ""
"the runtime chosen in the Cellaris panel points at {}, which does not exist"
msgstr "Cellaris 패널에서 선택한 런타임이 가리키는 {}이(가) 존재하지 않습니다"

#. Translators: {source} is an environment variable or a
#. command-line option (not translated), {path} a path.
#: src/runtime.rs:150
msgid "{source} points at {path}, which does not exist"
msgstr "{source}이(가) 가리키는 {path}이(가) 존재하지 않습니다"

#. Translators: {path} is the folder the user chose for ONNX
#. Runtime, {library} the file name of its library.
#: src/runtime.rs:165
msgid ""
"the runtime chosen in the Cellaris panel points at {path}, which holds no "
"{library}"
msgstr ""
"Cellaris 패널에서 선택한 런타임이 가리키는 {path}에 {library}이(가) 없습니다"

#. Translators: {source} is an environment variable or a
#. command-line option (not translated), {path} a folder,
#. {library} the file name of ONNX Runtime's library.
#: src/runtime.rs:175
msgid "{source} points at {path}, which holds no {library}"
msgstr "{source}이(가) 가리키는 {path}에 {library}이(가) 없습니다"

#. Translators: where to get ONNX Runtime on Windows; file and release
#. names are not translated.
#: src/runtime.rs:334
msgid "onnxruntime.dll from the onnxruntime-win-x64 release"
msgstr "onnxruntime-win-x64 릴리스의 onnxruntime.dll"

#. Translators: where to get ONNX Runtime on macOS; `brew install
#. onnxruntime` is a command, and file and release names are not
#. translated.
#: src/runtime.rs:339
msgid ""
"`brew install onnxruntime`, or libonnxruntime.dylib from the onnxruntime-osx "
"release"
msgstr ""
"`brew install onnxruntime` 또는 onnxruntime-osx 릴리스의 libonnxruntime.dylib"

#. Translators: where to get ONNX Runtime on Linux; file and release
#. names are not translated.
#: src/runtime.rs:344
msgid ""
"libonnxruntime.so from the onnxruntime-linux release, or your distribution's "
"package"
msgstr "onnxruntime-linux 릴리스의 libonnxruntime.so 또는 배포판의 패키지"

#. Translators: {version} is a version number, {platform} says where to
#. get ONNX Runtime for this computer; CELLARIS_ORT_DYLIB is an
#. environment variable (not translated).
#: src/runtime.rs:351
msgid ""
"Install ONNX Runtime {version} or newer ({platform}), then choose it in the "
"Cellaris panel, set CELLARIS_ORT_DYLIB, or put it in the plugin's data "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"ONNX Runtime {version} 이상({platform})을 설치한 다음 Cellaris 패널에서 선택"
"하거나, CELLARIS_ORT_DYLIB을 설정하거나, 플러그인의 데이터 디렉터리에 넣으세"
"요."

#: src/runtime.rs:374
msgid "ONNX Runtime was not found"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime을 찾을 수 없습니다"

#: src/runtime.rs:378
msgid "ONNX Runtime could not be loaded"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime을 불러올 수 없습니다"

#. Translators: {path} is an ONNX Runtime library, {source} where it was
#. found, {what} what went wrong with it.
#: src/runtime.rs:390
msgid "{path} ({source}): {what}"
msgstr "{path}({source}): {what}"

#. Translators: "it" is a library file; {} is why the system could
#. not open it.
#: src/runtime.rs:431
msgid "it could not be opened: {}"
msgstr "열 수 없습니다: {}"

#. Translators: "it" is a library file; OrtGetApiBase is a name
#. in ONNX Runtime (not translated).
#: src/runtime.rs:438
msgid "it is not ONNX Runtime (it has no OrtGetApiBase)"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime이 아닙니다(OrtGetApiBase 없음)"

#. Translators: "it" is a library file; OrtGetApiBase is a name in
#. ONNX Runtime (not translated).
#: src/runtime.rs:446
msgid "it is not ONNX Runtime (OrtGetApiBase returned nothing)"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime이 아닙니다(OrtGetApiBase가 아무것도 반환하지 않음)"

#. Translators: "it" is a library file; {version} and {needed}
#. are version numbers.
#: src/runtime.rs:465
msgid "it is ONNX Runtime {version}, older than {needed}"
msgstr "{needed}보다 오래된 ONNX Runtime {version}입니다"

#. Translators: {reason} is why ONNX Runtime was not found, {hint}
#. how to install it.
#: src/runtime.rs:522
msgid ""
"{reason}.\n"
"{hint}"
msgstr ""
"{reason}.\n"
"{hint}"

#. Translators: "it" is an ONNX Runtime library.
#: src/runtime.rs:553
msgid "opening it crashed"
msgstr "여는 중 충돌이 발생했습니다"

#. Translators: {} is why ONNX Runtime could not be
#. loaded, in its own words.
#: src/runtime.rs:586
msgid "{}. Restart eov to try again."
msgstr "{}. 다시 시도하려면 eov를 다시 시작하세요."

#. Translators: "it" is an ONNX Runtime library.
#: src/runtime.rs:596
msgid "loading it crashed. Restart eov to try again."
msgstr ""
"불러오는 중 충돌이 발생했습니다. 다시 시도하려면 eov를 다시 시작하세요."

#. Translators: {} is a version number.
#: src/runtime.rs:606
msgid "The ONNX Runtime found is older than {}"
msgstr "찾은 ONNX Runtime이 {}보다 오래된 버전입니다"

#. Translators: {attempts} lists the libraries tried, one per line,
#. {hint} says how to install ONNX Runtime.
#: src/runtime.rs:613
msgid ""
"Tried:\n"
"{attempts}\n"
"\n"
"{hint}"
msgstr ""
"시도한 위치:\n"
"{attempts}\n"
"\n"
"{hint}"

#. Translators: keep the full meaning: predicted, research only, no diagnosis.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:308
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "PREDICTED — research use only, not for diagnosis"
msgstr "예측값 — 연구용으로만 사용, 진단에 사용할 수 없음"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:314
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "No slide"
msgstr "슬라이드 없음"

#. Translators: closes the Cellaris panel.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:408
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "닫기"

#. Translators: keep the full meaning; IF is immunofluorescence.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:435
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"The colours show what a model predicts the immunofluorescence would be. They "
"are not measurements: check them against measured IF before relying on them."
msgstr ""
"색은 모델이 예측한 면역형광 결과를 나타냅니다. 측정값이 아니므로, 신뢰하기 전"
"에 실제로 측정한 면역형광(IF)과 대조해 확인하세요."

#. Translators: tries again what failed (the model, cells).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:460
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Retry"
msgstr "다시 시도"

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:472
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "SLIDE"
msgstr "슬라이드"

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:489
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "PREDICTED MARKERS"
msgstr "예측 마커"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:495
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Hide predictions"
msgstr "예측 숨기기"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:495
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Show predictions"
msgstr "예측 표시"

#. Translators: {} is a marker, such as Pan-CK.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:551
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Display window of {} (arcsinh)"
msgstr "{} 표시 범위(arcsinh)"

#. Translators: the low end of a marker's display window: at or below it
#. nothing is drawn (black in fluorescence style).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:560
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Low"
msgstr "하한"

#. Translators: the high end of a marker's display window: at or above it the
#. marker is drawn in its full colour.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:588
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "High"
msgstr "상한"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:615
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Only how predictions are drawn changes; readouts and batch runs keep their "
"values."
msgstr ""
"예측을 그리는 방식만 바뀌며, 분석 결과와 일괄 실행의 값은 그대로 유지됩니다."

#. Translators: resets a marker's display window to Cellaris's own.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:622
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "초기화"

#. Translators: how opaque the predicted colours are drawn.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:636
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "불투명도"

#. Translators: {} is the opacity, in percent.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:652
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "{} %"
msgstr "{}%"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:662
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Fluorescence style: colour on black over all tissue"
msgstr "형광 스타일: 모든 조직을 검은 바탕 위의 색으로 표시"

#. Translators: a check box; other messages quote its first words.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:671
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Assume the model's pixel size for slides that report none"
msgstr "모델의 픽셀 크기로 가정(픽셀 크기 정보가 없는 슬라이드)"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:678
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Colours are chosen to stay distinct with red-green and blue-yellow colour "
"blindness; hide markers to look at one at a time. Areas still being computed "
"are veiled; failed ones are outlined in red."
msgstr ""
"색은 적록 색각 이상과 청황 색각 이상에서도 구별되도록 선택되었습니다. 한 번"
"에 하나씩 보려면 나머지 마커를 숨기세요. 아직 계산 중인 영역은 반투명하게 가"
"려지고, 실패한 영역은 빨간색 윤곽선으로 표시됩니다."

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English: statistics of the
#. model's predicted values over a region (not a measurement).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:684
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "REGION READOUT"
msgstr "영역 분석"

#. Translators: a column of the readout: the marker.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:707
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "marker"
msgstr "마커"

#. Translators: a narrow column of the readout: the mean predicted value.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:709
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "mean"
msgstr "평균"

#. Translators: a narrow column of the readout: how much the value varies.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:711
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "spread"
msgstr "산포"

#. Translators: a narrow column: how much optical density alone explains.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:713
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "density r²"
msgstr "밀도 r²"

#. Translators: picks the tool that outlines a region for a readout of the
#. predicted values.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:734
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Draw region"
msgstr "영역 그리기"

#. Translators: makes the slide's region of interest (ROI) the readout's
#. region, instead of a drawn one; the readout follows the ROI.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:741
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Use ROI"
msgstr "ROI 사용"

#. Translators: stops the region readout.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:751
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "취소"

#. Translators: copies the region readout as text.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:758
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "복사"

#. Translators: removes the readout's region and its readout.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:766
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "지우기"

#. Translators: explains the readout's columns; keep the meaning exact; the 5
#. µm blocks are small squares of tissue, not paraffin blocks.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:775
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Mean is the predicted intensity, arcsinh, over tissue in the region, and "
"spread how much it varies between 5 µm blocks. Density r² is how much of "
"that variation optical density alone reproduces. Near 1, the marker is a "
"density map here. Low with a small spread means the prediction is flat, not "
"that it learned anything. Low with a wide spread is needed for it to be the "
"marker, but only measured IF shows it is. Numbers come from the same blended "
"predictions the overlay shows."
msgstr ""
"평균은 영역 안 조직에서 예측된 강도(arcsinh)의 평균이고, 산포는 그 값이 5 µm "
"블록 사이에서 얼마나 달라지는지를 나타냅니다. 밀도 r²은 그 변동 중 광학 밀도"
"만으로 재현되는 정도입니다. 1에 가까우면 이 영역에서 해당 마커는 밀도 맵에 지"
"나지 않습니다. r²이 낮고 산포가 작으면 예측이 평탄하다는 뜻일 뿐, 모델이 무언"
"가를 학습했다는 뜻이 아닙니다. r²이 낮고 산포가 넓어야 예측이 실제 마커일 수 "
"있지만, 실제로 그런지는 측정한 IF만이 보여 줍니다. 수치는 오버레이에 표시되"
"는 것과 같은 혼합 예측에서 계산됩니다."

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:781
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "MODEL"
msgstr "모델"

#. Translators: opens a file dialog to choose the model file.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:805
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Choose model…"
msgstr "모델 선택…"

#. Translators: opens a form to download the model through eov.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:807
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Download model…"
msgstr "모델 다운로드…"

#. Translators: opens a file dialog to choose ONNX Runtime's library.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:809
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Choose runtime…"
msgstr "런타임 선택…"

#. Translators: above the fields for the model's address and SHA-256.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:824
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Your site's copy of the model, and its SHA-256:"
msgstr "소속 기관의 모델 사본 주소와 SHA-256:"

#. Translators: hex digits are 0–9 and a–f.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:834
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "SHA-256 (64 hex digits)"
msgstr "SHA-256(16진수 64자리)"

#. Translators: downloads the model from the address given.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:840
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Download"
msgstr "다운로드"
